OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters hiding behind data      
OL,4,Aprotection on Sir Galahad bombing      
OL,5,Afiles, says veteran                    
OL,7,FA Falklands War veteran who was left   
OL,8,Fseverely burned in an attack on his    
OL,9,Fship has accused ministers of hiding   
OL,10,Fbehind data protection in refusing to  
OL,11,Frelease all files on the bombing.      
OL,13,FThe undefended supply ship Sir Galahad 
OL,14,Fwas hit by Argentinian planes in June  
OL,15,F1982m killing 48 people, including 32  
OL,16,FWelsh Guards.                          
OL,18,FThe Welsh Guards had previously been   
OL,19,Fblamed for not leaving the ship        
OL,20,Fearlier, but files released later      
OL,21,Fcleared them of any blame.             
